{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19629","headline":"怨回纥歌 · 皇甫松","name":"怨回纥歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首南朝女，愁听异域歌。\n收兵颉利国，饮马胡芦河。\n毳布腥膻久，穹庐岁月多。\n鵰巢城上宿，吹笛泪滂沱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}